#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/compliance-monitoring.rst:2
msgid "Compliance monitoring"
msgstr "컴플라이언스 모니터링"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/ent-plus.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Enterprise and Enterprise Advanced plans"
